	(text_box "Waveshare 1.69inch LCD module\n\nhttps://www.waveshare.com/wiki/1.69inch_LCD_Module\n\nThe 1.69inch LCD uses the GH1.25 8PIN interface\n\nVCC can be 3V3 or 5V0\nDIN to MOSI\nCLK to SCLK\nCS to digital IO\nDC to digital IO\nRST to digital IO\nBL to digital IO"
